#### `Task`s

- `./cursor/todo` contains potnential `tasks`
- all of `tasks` should be listed in `./cursor/todo/INDEX.md` which should be kept updated and readed first by `worker`
- not all `tasks` are actual `tasks` - some are `ideas` or `suggestions`, every task should be MDC files with header containging (only `name`, `number` & `status` are required):
``` mdc
---
name: Task Name
description: Task Description
type: [feature | bugfix | refactor | chore | docs | test | style | perf]
scope: [docs | design | deploy | build | content | code | ...]
number: [1 | 2 | 3 | ...]
status: [idea | backlog | task | WIP | done]
priority: [low | medium | high | critical]
dependencies: [file1, file2, ...]
tags: [tag1, tag2, ...]
```

- `./cursor/todo/content` contains content for `tasks`
- `./cursor/todo/content/TOOLTIP-CONTENT.md` contains content for `tooltips`
